[00:03.16]GRAY MAN
[00:04.42]Dress is in tatters
[00:06.59]Hope has been shattered
[00:08.58]Someone you love is gone
[00:12.24]
[00:12.24]GRAY MAN / CHARLI
[00:12.64]Out on the beach head
[00:14.86]Walking and reaching
[00:16.83]Cursing another dawn
[00:20.27]
[00:20.27]GRAY MAN
[00:20.85]Still he will try to
[00:23.07]Come back and find you
[00:25.15]And you will start to wonder
[00:30.33]
[00:30.33]GRAY MAN / CHARLI
[00:31.42]In whispered wind rushing in my ear
[00:35.11]In all the words that I almost hear
[00:39.24]In every silence, in every tear
[00:43.27]Is that you?
[00:50.40]
[00:50.40]CHARLI
[00:52.04]Hand on the wire
[00:54.11]Sand in the tire
[00:56.17]Why did we leave that pier?
[00:59.98]
[00:59.98]GRAY MAN / CHARLI
[01:00.30]Thought we were honest
[01:02.40]We made a promise
[01:04.49]Said that we’d come back here
[01:08.27]
[01:08.27]CHARLI
[01:08.56]When will you free me?
[01:10.37]
[01:10.37]GRAY MAN
[01:10.66]When will you see me?
[01:12.54]
[01:12.54]GRAY MAN / CHARLI
[01:12.83]When does the wondering end?
[01:15.96]
[01:15.96]GRAY MAN / CHARLI
[01:16.65]In whispered wind rushing in my ear,
[01:20.68]In all the words that I almost hear,
[01:24.77]In every silence, in every tear,
[01:28.81]Is that you?
[01:33.06]
[01:33.06]In searing pain from the summer’s heat
[01:37.13]In ice cold waves running through my feet
[01:41.17]A seagull flies out above the sea—
[01:45.21]Is that you?
[01:53.04]
[01:53.04]No…
[02:06.18]
[02:06.18]You’re in the eye of the hurricane
[02:10.25]You’re in the sunshine, you’re in the rain
[02:14.54]Along the shore walks a man in gray
[02:18.43]Is that you?
[02:26.32]
